        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amybeth McNulty, Lucy Maud Montgomery, Moira Walley-Beckett, Dalila Bela\n- Products: Anne, Anne with an E, Anne of Green Gables, Emily's Quest, Emily trilogy, Odd Squad\n- Organizations: CBC, Netflix, PBS Kids\n\nFacts:\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery published the novel Anne of Green Gables.\n- Emily's Quest is a novel by Lucy Maud Montgomery and the final book in the Emily trilogy.\n- Anne is a Canadian television series based on Anne of Green Gables by Lucy Maud Montgomery.\n- On Netflix, the television series Anne is titled Anne with an E.\n- Moira Walley-Beckett adapted the television series Anne.\n- In 2017, Amybeth McNulty starred as Anne Shirley in the CBC and Netflix series Anne.\n- Dalila Bela, born on October 5, 2001, is a Canadian actress known for playing Agent Olive on PBS Kids' Odd Squad and for appearing in Once Upon a Time and Anne.",
